                    "script": "\n\tpolicyInfo \u003d dict(self.view.custom.policyInfo)\n\tuserId \u003d system.kanoa.security.getIDPUserId(self.session.props.auth.user)\n\t\n\tif policyInfo[\u0027partInventoryPolicyId\u0027] is not None:\n\t\tretVal, msg \u003d system.kanoa.inventory.updatePartInventoryPolicy(policyInfo, userId)\n\telse:\n\t\tsystem.perspective.sendMessage(\u0027showInfoToast\u0027, {\u0027message\u0027: \u0027Adding records\u0027})\t\n\t\tmaintenanceTypeId, msg \u003d system.kanoa.inventory.addPartInventoryPolicy(policyInfo, userId)\n\t\t\n\tif msg:\tsystem.perspective.sendMessage(\u0027showFailerToast\u0027, {\u0027message\u0027: \"Couldn\u0027t save this record. %s\"%msg})\n\telse: system.perspective.sendMessage(\u0027showSuccessfulToast\u0027, {\u0027message\u0027: \"Record has been saved\"})\n\n\tsystem.perspective.sendMessage(\"refreshPolicies\", {})\t\n\tsystem.perspective.closePopup(\u0027\u0027)\n\t\n\treturn"
